<title>USA: TENNIS-AMERICA'S RED CLAY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AMERICA'S RED CLAY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CORAL SPRINGS, Florida 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $245,000 America's Red Clay Tennis Championship on Monday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>2-Petr Korda (Czech Republic) beat Neville Godwin (South Africa) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Sargis Sargsian (Armenia) beat 3-Alex O'Brien (U.S.) 3-6 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>5-Byron Black (Zimbabwe) beat Marcos Ondruska (South Africa) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Juan Albert Viloca (Spain) beat 8-Gilbert Schaller (Austria) 7-6 (7-3) 6-2</p>
<p>Luke Jensen (U.S.) beat Stephane Simian (France) 6-7 (5-7) 7-6 (7-4) 6-3</p>
<p>Mark Woodforde (Australia) beat Dennis van Scheppingen (Netherlands) 6-3 6-7 (3-7) 6-1</p>
<p>Patrik Fredriksson (Sweden) beat Ivan Baron (U.S.) 6-0 6-2</p>
</text>
